 "inference": [
  "Six of the 11 differences have an EA figure (IFV AP, canister and HE rounds; High Velocity anti-air heat). In all six the registry default is EA's new number and the own value EA's old one. For these properties the registry-first rule of L3356 holds without exception.",
  "The machine gun velocity of L3371 therefore stands alone as the case where the file is newer than the registry.",
  "Five differences have no EA line: Aim-Guided Missile magazine (file 2, registry 1), Mk 82 bomb rate (300, 1200), coaxial LMG rate (700, 720), Thermal Scanner rate (3600, 300) and Scout Helicopter minigun heat per bullet (0.006667, 0.008889, that is 150 or 112 shots to overheat). By the rule the registry value is the current one; unconfirmed.",
  "Most heat rows have no registry row (54 objects); for those the own value is the only source."
 ],
 "unresolved": [
